entService --&gt; View : profile data\ndeactivate ClientService\n\nView -&gt; View : setProfile(data)\n\nView --&gt; Learner : Display learner profile\ndeactivate View\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="JpxPkKv9E4pBiFouIRD--169">
